  <!-- Five-aircraft deployment: only trajectory-intent writers are affected.
       50 ms follows the trajectory refresh cadence; it is NOT a delivery bound.
       Fast DDS 2.6 defaults to a 3 s periodic heartbeat. Leave all other times,
       Reliable/KeepLast QoS, publication mode, and memory policy unchanged.
       ROS Humble matches the fully-qualified ROS topic, without the DDS rt prefix.
       Do not set RMW_FASTRTPS_USE_QOS_FROM_XML=1 for this profile. -->
